%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: MuratIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Merhaba, officer! Fine post for a grim day, no? My papers, my ID,
      and this lucky chestnut, which is optional. Murat Celik. Trader, mostly
      textiles.
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: I've been a travelling merchant for thirty years. Before that, my
      father was one. The bazaar never fully closes, not even at the end of the
      world.
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Are people still trading?
      npcResponse: More than ever! Different goods, less silk, more batteries.
        But the instinct to barter, that's very human. It doesn't go away.
      animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    - playerChoiceText: Isn't it dangerous to travel right now?
      npcResponse: Everything's dangerous! The dangerous roads and the safe ones
        both lead somewhere interesting. I check the wind and I go.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I live with my son and his family. Three grandchildren, very noisy,
      the best thing about a house. I've carried this chestnut for twenty years.
      It's never failed me.
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: You seem like a man who appreciates a steady thing. This checkpoint
      is a steady thing. My permit, December expiry. I keep it next to the chestnut.
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Is the tea house still open?
      npcResponse: It was, yesterday anyway! Samuil makes the black tea. Very
        strong. The world may be ending but that man's tea is not.
      animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    - playerChoiceText: You seem very calm about all this.
      npcResponse: I've seen three market crashes, two floods, and one very aggressive
        goat. Perspective is everything.
      animationTrigger: TalkSmile
